==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|vz|jmout|lang=cs}} via an ancient form *vz-jęti, hence ''[[vzal]]'' (for *vz-jal).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/vziːt/|lang=cs}}
* {{audio|Cs-vzít.ogg|audio|lang=cs}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=p|aa=brát}}

# {{lb|cs|transitive}} to [[take]]
# {{lb|cs|reflexive|si}} to [[marry]] ''sb.'', to [[get married]] to ''sb.''

